OL,3,GNEWSAHow much has the health care
OL,4,Asystem changed 10 years on from Bengoa?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decade ago Northern Ireland's health
OL,7,Fservice was likened to a "burning
OL,8,Fplatform" - where there was such urgent
OL,9,Fpressure that "standing still is no
OL,10,Flonger a viable option".
OL,12,FThe man who described it that way, Prof
OL,13,FRaphael Bengoa, published a 2016 review
OL,14,Fthat was supposed to change the way
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland does healthcare.
OL,17,FHis proposition was practical but
OL,18,Fambitious: that a system under
OL,19,Frelentless pressure could not simply
OL,20,Ftreat more patients, run similar
OL,21,Fservices in different hospitals and
OL,22,Fspend more money.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
