OL,3,GNEWSAHow much has the health care
OL,4,Asystem changed 10 years on from Bengoa?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe name Bengoa came to represent
OL,7,Fsomething that Northern Ireland's
OL,8,Fhealth service desperately needed: the
OL,9,Fpossibility of improvement and change.
